# אלכס נכסים — כללי סוכן

Before changing product behavior, read and follow:
- `docs/SPEC.md` (source of truth for requirements)
- `docs/PROJECT_RULES.md` (workflow, accessibility, privacy, design)
- `docs/DATA_CHECKLIST.md` (client-provided assets; do not invent final business contact details)

## Non-negotiables
- Public site: Hebrew only, RTL. Admin: Hebrew + Russian.
- Budget: free tiers only unless the user explicitly approves paid services.
- Only Alex (admin) can publish properties. No public property submission to live listings.
- Public address: city + neighborhood + optional street name — never building/apartment number.
- Missing price → display "צור קשר לבירור".
- No free-text search, no map, no blog/CMS in v1.
- Admin UI is mobile-first (Alex works from phone browser only).
- Never expose private property fields (`owner*`, `internalNotes`, `exactAddress`, `minPriceNegotiable`) via public API or HTML.
- Accessibility: build to IS 5568 / WCAG 2.0 AA in code (not overlay-only).
- Privacy: Amendment 13 — privacy policy link + unchecked consent checkbox on forms collecting PII.
- Static marketing copy lives in code; not editable in admin in v1.
- Requirement changes → update `docs/SPEC.md` first, then code.

## Stack lock
Next.js App Router + TypeScript + Tailwind + managed MongoDB free (`MONGODB_URI`: Atlas M0 / OVH Discovery / Clever Cloud) + Vercel free + Cloudinary/Blob free + Auth.js + wa.me (no WhatsApp Business API in v1).

Do not publish internal-tool entry URLs, passwords, or gate tokens in README, public docs, footer, or chat that may be committed.
